  "string/en/loading/hutta.stf": [
   [
    "hutta",
    "Nal Hutta, in the Y'Toub system, is the throne world of the Hutt kajidics. Centuries of industry and neglect have left it a warm, stinking swamp under a yellow haze, with Nar Shaddaa hanging in its sky."
   ],
   [
    "bilbousa",
    "The capital squats on a shelf of firm ground above the brown water. Every kajidic of note keeps a tower here, and every visitor pays someone for the privilege of leaving."
   ],
   [
    "swamps",
    "Beyond the city the land sinks into brown, warm water and rotting reeds. Little that lives out there is friendly, and none of it is clean."
   ]
  ],
  "string/en/loading/hutta_n.stf": [
